    cpi:text "ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE ONLY. Example Borrower applies for an SME home loan. Example Policy version 1.0 contains section Eligibility and rule R-LTV: for SME home loans in India, LTV must be at most 80 percent. An exception permits at most 85 percent when a compensating collateral condition is satisfied and a credit manager approves. A valuation report is required. The example policy is effective from 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31. DTI and credit score are metric definitions only; no thresholds for them are asserted."^^xsd:string ;
    cpi:version "1.0"^^xsd:string .

